;; Source paths are RELATIVE, and deliberately so.
;;
;; `infra.publication-source-revision/document-path` resolves a relative path
;; against the parent of the contract root the resource was loaded from, and
;; `resource-source-root` derives that from the resource file's own provenance.
;; In the container CONTRACTS_DIR is `/app/contracts`, so the parent is `/app`
;; and these resolve to `/app/publication-source/...` — exactly where
;; compose.yaml mounts `./publication-source`.
;;
;; The absolute `/app/...` spellings these replace resolved to the same file in
;; the container and to nothing anywhere else, so a local instance could not read
;; its own document source and every revision came back nil — which the gate
;; reads as "no source", deriving no translation work at all and silently.
;; Relative is the same path in the container and a working one outside it.
